The material in those two skills is condensed and rewritten to fit Ultrapowers'
own skill format, vocabulary, and model-invoked flow — it is not a verbatim
copy of Impeccable's reference documents, which run to roughly 5,000 lines
across ~20 commands. Ultrapowers ships a small subset (the design-purpose
taxonomy, the quality floor, eight named refinement moves, the audit rubric,
and the hardening checklist) and omits Impeccable's CLI, browser live-mode,
detector hooks, and native-platform tooling entirely.

